	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Two JST PH 6-pin (MG310 motor + Hall A/B)\nESD -> 100 Ohm + 1 nF -> SN74LVC3G17\nEncoder supply 5V0 (or 3V3) via 100 mA PTC\nThird buffer input grounded (no index)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.54 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "01c5a9c5-f688-5ffc-9acf-68d6985935f0")
	)
	(text "DRV8711, PWMMODE 1 (indexer bypass)\nFour CSD88537ND half-bridges, SS34 clamps\nRsense 50 mOhm + Kelvin taps, trip 2.0 A\nVM bulk 220 uF, charge pump, pull-ups"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0369046c-a1f2-576d-ab2d-09e504a3c4f8")
	)
	(text "RF1 -> MLPF-WB55-01E3 filter / match\n50 Ohm GCPW -> pi tuning (DNP shunts)\nPrinted IFA (TI SWRA117D)\nDNP U.FL conducted test port"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 322.58 74.93 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c02e436-149d-512a-baf2-57f360f35b9a")
	)
	(text "MPU-6500 6-axis IMU on SPI2, INT to PC6\nW25Q16JV 16 Mbit flash on SPI1\n(shared with the DRV8711)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.06 128.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "215e1f0b-f165-5a79-8ec4-c258433e4d35")
	)
	(text "Status LED (PB0) + 12 RGB LEDs (PA7)\nQwiic I2C3 + ESD, M24C64 EEPROM\nST25DV04KC NFC tag + printed coil\nNo buttons, no buzzer (D-035)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 322.58 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "63c9e3f6-6aeb-5dbd-a575-4c5822d47ea5")
	)
	(text "Two-wheeled self-balancing robot. The PCB is the chassis: STM32WB55 (BLE), DRV8711 driving two MG310 gear\nmotors through external half-bridges, MPU-6500 IMU, 3S LiPo. Firmware: github.com/embedded-pro/e-inverted-pendulum"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "708ff89b-58db-5acf-b3ae-c915d62228b3")
	)
	(text "XT30 3S LiPo input, 4 A fuse\nAO4805 back-to-back P-FET switch:\nreverse polarity, soft start, SW101\nSMBJ15A clamp, VBAT sense divider"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 74.93 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "99547633-499e-5d92-8544-e5800e9e714e")
	)
	(text "e-inverted-pendulum  rev A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9a4513fe-4201-53bb-b59e-931b5f0e3b0b")
	)
	(text "TPS62933F buck VBAT -> +5V, 1.2 MHz\nEN UVLO: start 9.1 V, stop 8.5 V\nTLV75533P LDO +5V -> +3V3, 500 mA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.54 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b362b578-b568-57eb-ac25-185cf6c06b38")
	)
	(text "Ground: one GND, L2 solid and never cut. The motor current returns through Rsense R509 / R512 at the bridges;\nthe Kelvin taps NT501 / NT502 keep the sense lines off the power ground.  Numbering: sheet n uses references n01-n99.\nSources for every value: docs/design-calcs.md, docs/decisions.md, simulation/REPORT.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bdab7cc7-a6e2-5ba5-9f35-4d4b0c0547d9")
	)
	(text "STM32WB55RGV6 (BLE 5), pin map from\npin-data/pinmap.csv; core SMPS, HSE 32 MHz,\nLSE 32.768 kHz, NRST / BOOT0 pads,\nSTDC14 SWD + virtual COM port"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.06 74.93 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d4c3477d-7f76-5929-9cbe-328e5bb97d93")
	)
	(text "Power flow:  3S LiPo (9.0-12.6 V) -> XT30 J101 -> 4 A fuse F101 -> back-to-back P-FET switch Q101 (reverse polarity,\nsoft start, SW101) -> VBAT -> SMBJ15A clamp -> DRV8711 + four CSD88537ND half-bridges -> MG310 motors\nVBAT -> TPS62933F buck -> +5V (encoders, buzzer, LDO) -> TLV75533P LDO -> +3V3 (MCU, IMU, flash, I2C devices)\nMCU core: +3V3 -> internal SMPS (L301 + L302) -> VFBSMPS;  VDDA through ferrite FB301"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d6da2431-ad8d-5573-bbeb-e59f16c75dc0")
	)
